ive system is now continuous-only and several older capabilities/UI pieces were removed, while the README and config still describe some of them. Luce correctly kept that separate from the regression. fileciteturn0file0L72-L78\n\n### My read on the two Don decisions\n\n1. **Approve the single-word exact-match repair.** That is directly evidenced and low blast-radius.\n2. **Retire bare `sleep` / `wake up` as reserved commands.** Use deliberate phrases such as `stop listening` / `start listening` instead. Given your normal dictation patterns, `Sleep.` is too common a word to own globally as a control token.\n\nAnd importantly, Luce confirmed there is only **one live VoiceBridge tree**, launched manually from the same working directory; we are not fighting a duplicate runtime. fileciteturn0file0L4-L15\n\nSo the next move should be **Nico correction only**, not another broad optimization pass.\n\nI can give you the exact **Nico surgical-fix prompt** next, with explicit test cases for `Right`, `Up`, `Down`, `Left`, `Enter`, `Send`, `Space`, `Save`, `Copy`, `Quote`, `Who`, plus the `Sleep`/`start listening` change."]}, "create_time": 1790283586.384117, "end_turn": true, "id": "ebf9463a-5758-4d47-9578-e35233e43ae0", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [{"citation_format_type": "berry_file_search", "end_ix": 433, "metadata": {"extra": {"api_tool_source": "files/context_stuff", "authors_display": null, "cited_message_id": "3cad0b9c-c2aa-475e-bf13-c79aab0d62df", "cited_message_idx": 29, "cloud_doc_url": null, "doi": null, "effective_time": null, "journal_homepage_url": null, "journal_name": null, "library_file_id": "libfile_0ff357eaf20c819193c84b3d7d5efef6", "line_range": [54, 65], "publication_year": null, "retrieval_file_index": 0, "retrieval_turn": 0, "run_id": null, "search_result_idx": null, "set_id": null, "source_icon_url": null, "source_label": null, "source_url": null, "spl_version": null, "title": null}, "id": "file_00000000dc7482098c64935c217ed37b",